  "purpose": "Map raw review-library brand labels to canonical brand identities without overwriting source evidence.",
  "principles": [
    "The raw brand value remains immutable source evidence.",
    "A regional or official channel may map to a canonical brand, but the channel identity is retained as an alias.",
    "Creators, publishers, agencies and collaborations are not silently converted into a single brand.",
    "Every source value receives an explicit processing outcome; unverified review-console brand fields become proposed candidates, never verified identities.",
    "A proposed identity cannot enter product UI until an official logo source and visual/legal review are recorded."
  ],
